  "description": "YITAMOTOR floor mats are made with high-density TPE material, using advanced 3D laser technology, which not only provides a superb feel and extreme wear resistance but also offers a precise fit to your vehicle floor.\nFitment\n2017-2021 Mazda CX-5\nOnly for carpet flooring.\nFeatures\nCustom Fit - With advanced 3D laser scanning tech, YITAMOTOR floor mats & cargo liner is compatible with 2017-2021 Mazda CX-5 Mazda CX5. Floor Type: Carpet Flooring.\nBuilt For Durability: YITAMOTOR floor mats & cargo mats are made from premium TPE material featuring high tensity for great comfort and wear resistance while remaining flexible and user-friendly even in extreme cold or hot environments; Product contains no latex, cadmium, lead, or any harmful PVC\nAll Season Protection & Non-Slip: The floor mats are uniquely designed channels and raised edges that can effectively trap liquid, debris, snow, mud, and sand to keep your car and shoes clean; Built-in retainer clips firmly grip the mat and prevent slipping when wet\nEasy To Clean: The waterproof floor mats simply shake the dirt out of the textured skid-resistant surface or spray down with a hose; No vacuuming or harsh chemicals are needed for maintenance\nWhy Choose YITAMOTOR: Our floor mats for cars are processed with advanced technology, rendering tailored protection and all-weather guards to your vehicle",
